# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for local dev. Issue #73's GIS consent
# flow simply doesn't render without this set — no calendar UI, no error.
#
# The OAuth client itself is a human step (Google console): register this
# origin plus hb.twinion.net against the client id below, requesting
# https://www.googleapis.com/auth/calendar.readonly. The sweeper's Workspace
# Internal OAuth client id may be reused here — this is an independent
# per-device credential; its refresh token and Tasks/Gmail scopes are
# untouched.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
